 // RUN79: the payload-free local hint from the actual connection module revokes ONLY this panel's cached bound plan/offer/consent actionability. It never grants, extends or resets native authority: an already-dispatched or attempted plan keeps its true RUNNING/terminal provenance untouched, an already confirmed result projection stays displayed, and the unsent user text is preserved. A later connection read that merely re-shows the same state restores nothing here — only an explicit fresh prepare from the current connection state may publish a NEW unchecked offer. Registered with options.signal, so panel teardown can never leak or revive this subscription.
